<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" style="padding:96px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="reveal" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:56px;">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Got Questions?</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="faq-item"><button onclick="toggleF(this)" style="width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;color:#1a2980;"><span>What are the class timings?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body" style="padding:0 24px;"><div style="padding-bottom:18px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.65;">Classes run all 7 days a week from 10 AM to 4 PM. Online sessions are also available on request.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button onclick="toggleF(this)" style="width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;color:#1a2980;"><span>Which grades do you teach?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body" style="padding:0 24px;"><div style="padding-bottom:18px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.65;">Grade 1 to Grade 12 (ages 6–18). Foundational sessions for 5-year-olds also available. Each group gets age-appropriate, fun learning methods.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button onclick="toggleF(this)" style="width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;color:#1a2980;"><span>Which boards / curriculum do you cover?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body" style="padding:0 24px;"><div style="padding-bottom:18px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.65;">CBSE, ICSE, SSC (State Board), and IGCSE. We also prepare students for Maths Olympiad (IMO, SOF), NTSE, and scholarship tests.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button onclick="toggleF(this)" style="width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;color:#1a2980;"><span>How many students per batch?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body" style="padding:0 24px;"><div style="padding-bottom:18px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.65;">Maximum 6–8 students per batch. Dedicated 1-on-1 sessions also available at a nominal extra cost for students who need individual support.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button onclick="toggleF(this)" style="width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;color:#1a2980;"><span>How do I enrol my child?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body" style="padding:0 24px;"><div style="padding-bottom:18px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.65;">WhatsApp or call us to book a FREE 30-minute trial class. We assess your child's level and suggest the right batch. Fees are monthly. No registration fees!</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button onclick="toggleF(this)" style="width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;color:#1a2980;"><span>What makes Mathematic's Laβ different?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body" style="padding:0 24px;"><div style="padding-bottom:18px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.65;">Three things: (1) Game-based learning in every lesson. (2) Custom board games students take home. (3) Annual Mathematics Carnival — a unique event making math a joyful celebration. We don't just teach math — we make children fall in love with it.</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

